<!--
  ⭐⭐ Phase W1 — Widget palette · LIGHT (brand emerald fallback).

  These 27 tokens mirror the Material 3 colour roles that Glance exposes
  through `GlanceTheme.colors`. On Android 12+ the `values-v31` / `values-night-v31`
  variants take over and re-tint the widget from the user's wallpaper
  (Material You). On older devices these emerald values keep the brand.

  Keep the token names in sync with `WidgetPalette.kt`.
-->
